::'''Gallagher:''' ...You've found some interesting ingredients there. Now, take your pick.
::'''Gallagher:''' Each drink has its own unique flavor, and the base ingredient sets the tone for the initial taste and the lingering aftertaste. So, {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|which one would you like to use as the base}}?
::'''Gallagher:''' Heh, you won't find a sweeter drink anywhere in Penacony, and that's what today's dream seekers crave.
::'''Gallagher:''' Sweeter than Sousa Juice and more bitter than Dream Syrup. {{Rubi|"Dream in a Bottle"|Soulglad}} &mdash; that's a metaphor for Penacony itself.
::'''Gallagher:''' The original formula is said to be Hanunue's favorite drink. It's sour and bitter, and the bubbles burst in your throat like swallowing rusty chains, evoking thoughts of dungeons and prisons.
::'''Gallagher:''' Now that you've chosen the base, it's time to pick the adjunct &mdash; the ingredient that'll create a marvelous chemical reaction with the base. It should give an unforgettable taste without overpowering the main tone. So, {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|what's your choice for the adjunct}}?
::'''Gallagher:''' Bright Future... a taste that's been a long time coming.
::'''Gallagher:''' I'll never forget the flavor that danced on my tongue as Mikhail whisked me through the Dreamscape wilderness. Those were haunting times... too beautiful to be real.
::'''Gallagher:''' The taste is... not very intense, yet evocative.
::'''Gallagher:''' After those despicables sent Mikhail away, I found myself lost in the wilderness of my dreams. They say that even the dirt here oozes with sweetness... Heh, all I tasted was stoic bitterness.
::'''Gallagher:''' This is the most pungent adjunct we have... and my personal favorite.
::'''Gallagher:''' Before Mikhail left, the wrinkles at the corners of his eyes had deepened, like knife cuts. He mumbled, his breath too weak to climb up his throat, caught up in his chest. But I could smell it... the lingering scent of Penacony itself on that night.
::'''Himeko:''' Mikhail...?
::'''Gallagher:''' Almost there. Let's pick a decoration. Which style do you prefer? Anything you need, I've got it.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Straws with concentric circles.
:::'''Gallagher:''' {{Rubi|Concentric circles|The Harmony}}... May you always remember where you started.
